          "message": {
            "text": "An explicit capture probe result must outrank the static shaper-class heuristic for covered marks. The probe observes Chromium's final paint decision: an empty result means Tai Tham stays bare or Balinese already owns its circle, while a positive UTF-16 index requests synthesis. The heuristic remains only for old captures/unit callers with no probe data, preserving uncovered positive controls.",
            "markdown": "An explicit capture probe result must outrank the static shaper-class heuristic for covered marks. The probe observes Chromium's final paint decision: an empty result means Tai Tham stays bare or Balinese already owns its circle, while a positive UTF-16 index requests synthesis. The heuristic remains only for old captures/unit callers with no probe data, preserving uncovered positive controls."
